{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>海通國際發佈研報稱，預期騰訊第三季收入2，102億元人民幣，同比增長9%；經調整經營溢利688億元人民幣，同比跌5%，主要由於AI相關折舊及產品投資反映在收入成本及營運開支中。</p>\n<p>該行指出，AI仍是騰訊的策略投資重點，短期折舊仍將拖累財務表現，但騰訊傾向紀律性部署，而非自動逐季加快支出。該行輕微下調目標價2%至470港元，以反映每股盈利預測下調，維持「優於大市」評級。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1021/ae55edd649d362d.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:39:40.368884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:25:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:30.060427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:37:45.614969+00:00","content_hash":"f1b31814cf47d6e501b151f7bb2d3c5d638e67cbda6259ce206fec76747c32aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}